overview before: No SMTP server is configured, and this installation fires reminders. They are recorded and wait in the queue; nobody is told until a mail server is configured.No egress allowlist is configured. In multi-tenant operation, outbound calls should be restricted to known hosts.This installation runs workspaces for others and names no accessibility statement, so a sign-in card shows none unless its workspace set one. Set it under Installation, Defaults, or with: hubctl admin settings set legal.accessibility_url <address>
